###Mental checklist for Service connectivity failures:

kubectl get pods — are pods actually Running ?
kubectl logs / kubectl exec ... curl localhost:<port> — is the app healthy inside the container?
kubectl get endpoints <svc> — does the selector match any pods?
kubectl get svc -o yaml — does targetPort match the port the app listens on?
Fix the mismatch and re-test from a client pod.


####Mental checklist for node scheduling failures:

kubectl get nodes — is the node Ready ?
kubectl describe node <name> — check Conditions and Events for root cause
SSH to the node → sudo systemctl status kubelet
Read kubelet logs: sudo journalctl -u kubelet
Check scheduling events: kubectl get events -n <namespace>



